  "notes": [
    "Canonical u/g/r/i/z and *_err are retained from Kepler et al. 2019 Table 2; use *_psf_flux_nanomaggies, *_psf_flux_ivar or *_psf_mag and *_psf_mag_err for independently recovered photometry.",
